    "created_at": "2020-06-09T08:01:08Z",
    "updated_at": "2020-06-09T08:01:08Z",
    "body": "This would be extremely difficult to implement in WebKit's architecture. Core Graphics doesn't have any facility for 3d operations. Trying to split a canvas into a Core Animation layer hierarchy would be a world of pain.\r\n\r\nIf authors want this effect, they can transform multiple canvas elements using CSS 3D transforms. Or, use WebGL.\r\n\r\nThe benefit doesn't seem worth the cost.",
